              Angle: quote to cash for equipment sellers - buyback,
              margin approvals, e-invoice. Not another CRM.
  /purchase   Purchase and procurement
              Angle: PO to GRN to bill with the conversion trail, and
              a payables aging you can act on.
  /inventory  Inventory, warehouse and spares
              Angle: serial and batch from receipt to consumption,
              dead stock and reorder in one screen.
  /service    Service and field operations   <- the flagship page,
