7. THE SINGLE MOST IMPORTANT THING IN THIS DOCUMENT
------------------------------------------------------------

Do not market this as a CRM or an ERP. Both categories are crowded,
commoditised, and price-anchored to Zoho.

Market it as the system for the ten years after the machine is sold -
and lead every conversation with the renewal and leakage numbers that
the service dashboard already computes. The features are deep enough
to win the evaluation. The positioning is what gets the evaluation.
